          "type": "markdown",
          "text": "A company has a customer loyalty program. In January 2018, there were 300 customers enrolled\nin the loyalty program. For the next 24 months after January 2018, the total number of customers\nenrolled in the loyalty program each month was $2\\%$ greater than the total number enrolled the\nprevious month. Which equation gives the total number of customers, $c$, enrolled in the\ncompany’$s$ loyalty program $m$ months after January 2018, where $m\\le 24$ ?"
        }
